{"3537350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "San Yin", "steam_appid": 3537350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanyin is a platform action music game. Under the Xuanhuan sky where the star rhythm has collapsed, use rhythm as a blade and dodge as a gap to rebuild the sound of the Heavenly Dao amid the glint of swords and shadows of blades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Twenty-Eight Mansions transformed into pitchpipes to guard the eight directions, until the &quot;Jiaosu Tianlü&quot; (Celestial Rhythm of the Horn Mansion) shattered bizarrely. From the broken part of the Heavenly Dao's strings gushed the &quot;Erosion Sound Miasma Curtain&quot;. Corrupted star officials are devouring the Three Realms with distorted sound waves, and the melody of all things is falling into irreversible collapse...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Editor: Freely import audio/images/animations to build an exclusive rhythm battlefield</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workshop Integration: Share or experience player-created world levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online System: Supports local multiplayer and Steam online multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty Selection: Multiple difficulty levels to suit different players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode Demo: 3 prologue levels unlocked as early access to the full story mode</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upcoming Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Story Mode: Over 20 main levels, more characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Gameplay: Diverse gameplay styles such as Endless Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More stable online methods</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Help and Feedback: View the manual on the right →</h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanyin is a platform action music game. Under the Xuanhuan sky where the star rhythm has 